            "abstract": "This Data-to-Knowledge Package (DKP) links the data and computational workflows required to reproduce a Soil and Water Assessment Tool (SWAT) simulation workflow in Galaxy Virtual Resarch Environment (VRE). The DKP integrates and structures the relevant data, computational workflows, toolboxes and metadata into a reproducible framework for investigating the following research question: How can changes in Land Use/Land Cover (LULC) affect river flow and water temperature at the river mouth? What is the monthly water quality variability?",
            "identifier": {
                "@id": "https://doi.org/10.23728/b2share.8fys5-vpx64"
            },
            "version": "1.6",
